          <description>DS §5.6.5.17 p.353. IN endpoint 1 TxFIFO size/start. Register Table 19 places DIEPTXF1 at 0x104 and DIEPTXF3 at 0x108 (standard DWC2 would put DIEPTXF3 at 0x10c); the datasheet's offsets are used. Reset start address printed '0x100 / 0x180' for the two instances. Note: For detailed configuration methods, see Section Reset 0x800100 (DS).</description>
          <addressOffset>0x104</addressOffset>
