            <field>
              <name>SuspSts</name>
              <description>Suspend Status Dev mode, the soft core detects a suspend condition and sets the bit. The soft core then enters the suspend state. The soft core exits the suspend state under any of the following conditions: • There is a level change on the phy_lin_state_i signal line; • DCTL.RmtWkUpSig is set [reset 0x0] [access RO]</description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <access>read-only</access>
            </field>
