              <name>InEpTxfEmpMsk</name>
              <description>One bit per IN endpoint (bit 0 = IN EP0 ... bit 15 = IN EP15), controls whether DIEPINTn.TxFEmp raises an interrupt. Printed in Chinese: 每个位标示一个IN端口，用于控制DIEPINTn.TxfEmp [reset 0x0] [access RO]</description>
