    <peripheral>
      <name>UART0</name>
      <description>UART0, Synopsys DesignWare APB UART, 16550-compatible (DS §5.4, p.268-285). Offsets 0x00/0x04/0x08 are shared: RBR/THR/DLL, IER/DLH (selected by LCR.DLAB) and IIR/FCR (read/write). FW: 28 access sites.</description>
