          <description>ADC Channel Configuration Register. DS §5.9.5.10 p.419. FW: 0 reads, 2 writes. Note: Single scan mode, ADC_CH_VLD Only the lowest-order channel is valid; when scanning multiple times, scan from the lowest-order channel to the highest-order channel in sequence. Note: in single-scan mode only the lowest enabled channel is converted; in continuous mode channels are scanned lowest to highest. Reset 0x0 (DS).</description>
          <addressOffset>0x24</addressOffset>
          <size>32</size>
          <access>read-write</access>
          <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
          <fields>
            <field>
              <name>ADC_CHH_VLD</name>
