    <peripheral derivedFrom="SPI_Master0">
      <name>SPI2</name>
      <description>SPI2. Same register table as SPI0 (DS Register Table 13, p.254). Some LCD_DB/RD/WR/RS/CS pins can be muxed to it via SystemControl.IO_DIPLEX2. FW: third entry of the SSI base table at 0x030ada08.</description>
