      <interrupt><name>SPI2</name><description>PIC source 23 (bit 23 of PIC_MASK/INT_ST), default CPU vector 55 (DS Table 30, p.168-169)</description><value>23</value></interrupt>
    </peripheral>
    <peripheral>
      <name>DAC</name>
      <description>CPU-side 12-bit DAC controller, three channels A-C (DS §5.10, p.423-426). Distinct from the baseband TX DAC (SystemControl.DAC_CONTROL). FW: 8 sites, writing PD_CTRL, PD_MODE_EN and all three data registers.</description>
