          <description>Digital Aliasing Control Register. DS §6.5.2.10 p.450. Window onto four indirect mixer registers (address in mix_add, data through DR_MIX at +0x11). MIX_0 (0x00): [7:6] aidacl_sel, [5:4] aidacr_sel (DAC1 modulator left/right input source: 00 same channel, 01 other channel, 10 (L+R)/2, 11 zero), [0] dac_mix (0: DAC only; 1: DAC+ADC). MIX_1 (0x01): [7:6] mixdacl_sel, [5:4] mixdacr_sel (DAC channel source into the mixer, same encoding). MIX_2 (0x02): [7:6] aiadcl_sel, [5:4] aiadcr_sel (ADC output to the port, same encoding), [0] mix_rec (0: ADC only; 1: ADC+DAC). MIX_3 (0x03): [7:6] mixadcl_sel, [5:4] mixadcr_sel (ADC channel source into the mixer, same encoding). All reset 0. Reset 0x0 (DS).</description>
