          <description>ADC AGC Read and write data of indirect. DS §6.5.2.37 p.468. Indirect ADC AGC registers (index in CR_ADC_AGC): ADC_AGC_0 (0x00): [6] agc_stereo (1: right uses left's configuration), [5:2] target (output amplitude target, Max_target minus 1.5 dB per step, reset 0xd). ADC_AGC_1 (0x01): [7] ng_en (noise gate), [6:4] ng_thr (MIN_NG_THR + 6 dB per step), [3:0] hold (time before AGC acts, 0 ms, 2 ms, doubling to 32.768 s; reset 0x7). ADC_AGC_2 (0x02): [7:4] atk, [3:0] dcy (gain ramp fall/rise time, 0010 = 96 ms then +32 ms per step to 512 ms; reset 0x4 each). ADC_AGC_3 (0x03): [4:0] agc_max (max gain, reset 0x1f). ADC_AGC_4 (0x04): [4:0] agc_min (min gain, reset 0). Gain codes: 1.5 dB steps to 22.5 dB at 01111, then 23, 23, 23, 24.5 ... 42.5 dB at 11111. Reset 0x0 (DS).</description>
          <addressOffset>0x30</addressOffset>
          <size>8</size>
